      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLDEN PHARAOH (2) is a quick dog who thrives over the short dashes. Faded to finish fourth over 457m at Q Lakeside (25.77) in a Grade 5 but is better placed coming back in trip. Goes very well at the journey winning six races. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Has ability and is a key runner. TUSKEN WIND (8) is better than last start when fourth (19.92) from Box 7 at this track over 366m. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Cannot be underestimated. NAUTICAL BLUE (6) jumped from this box and scrambled home to a narrow Grade 6 win at this track over 366m latest (20.11). Harder here but expected to feature again. TRUE HORNET (3) jumps at a shorter journey and still warrants respect.",
